unctions. Salvage downed UFOs to unlock new research levels using alien technology to improve your defenses as you fight to survive in deep space.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >MANUFACTURE UPGRADES</h2><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3082580/extras/f5920295726f7e497ab1d9aac822f1cf.poster.avif?t=1754105255\" width=602 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3082580/extras/f5920295726f7e497ab1d9aac822f1cf.webm?t=1754105255\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3082580/extras/f5920295726f7e497ab1d9aac822f1cf.mp4?t=1754105255\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>Build a workshop to build attachments for your pods. Manufacture radars and satellites to warn of incoming UFOs and other hazards and build missile launchers and gun turrets to defend against the alien invaders.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >FEATURES</h2><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3082580/extras/b302a41d4e1992380a14579f0aef560a.poster.avif?t=1754105255\" width=602 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3082580/extras/b302a41d4e1992380a14579f0aef560a.webm?t=1754105255\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3082580/extras/b302a41d4e1992380a14579f0aef560a.mp4?t=1754105255\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Stylized low poly 3D graphics<br></li><li>Simple game mechanics with short gameplay sessions<br></li><li>Accessible one-button mouse control<br></li><li>Campaign with 12 missions (about 1 hour to complete)<br></li><li>Unlockable endless Freeplay mode</li></ul>",
